> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (recommended) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.

**Goal:** Build an automated pixel-level visual comparison framework that compares BetterArc rendered frames against ArcCreate reference frames extracted from video, reporting SSIM scores and diff heatmaps via `dotnet test`.

**Architecture:** FFmpeg script extracts reference frames from ArcCreate export video. ImageSharp-based `ImageComparer` computes SSIM and generates heatmaps. `VisualTestBase` drives headless MonoGame rendering at each reference timestamp, then compares. xUnit test collects all frame results and outputs a summary report.

